OL,3,GNEWSAArt trail celebrates arrival of
OL,4,Ablack bears at zoo
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new public art trail will mark the
OL,7,Farrival of Asiatic black bears, Jersey
OL,8,FZoo has said.
OL,10,FSculptures of bears and bees would be
OL,11,Fput up across the island's wild
OL,12,Flandscapes, coastal spots and urban
OL,13,Fspaces to celebrate the arrival of the
OL,14,Fnew species in their new enclosure next
OL,15,Fyear, said bosses.
OL,17,FThey said the installation, which
OL,18,Flaunches in July next year, aimed to
OL,19,Fshine a light on "connections that
OL,20,Fsustain the natural world, from its
OL,21,Flargest inhabitants to its smallest".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
