OL,3,GNEWSAArt trail celebrates arrival of
OL,4,Ablack bears at zoo
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtists will be invited to submit
OL,7,Fdesigns to turn the sculptures into
OL,8,F"distinctive works of art" while
OL,9,Fschools and community groups will also
OL,10,Fbe encouraged to participate.
